   "lines": [
    "Under way 5.15.; the",
    "winds were light and",
    "baffling, and it was",
    "a dead calm from 9",
    "till 6.; so, though we",
    "worked well at the",
    "sweeps, we did not",
    "reach Oyster Bay till",
    "11.15.",
    "Al & Doc are not",
    "only good friends but",
    "extremely pleasant",
    "companions. The trip",
    "has been a great success."
   ],
